  "description": "She once saved the world as the fearsome Archmage of Despair. Her reward? Being reborn as Lesia Elphinad, child saint and unwilling subscriber to a pay-to-live reincarnation subscription where missing a payment could cost her life. Instead of enjoying toys and naps, she must complete divine quests, collect Heaven Coins, and live under the same roof as her former rival, the powerful light mage. With the help of old friends and new, can she turn a cursed second chance into a life worth living? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
